microalgae that are linked to diatoms and brown algae [37],
they have been utilized to make nutraceuticals and feed additives for decades [38]. Nannochloropsis sp. has been used
as an aquaculture feed ingredient, providing a supply of
omega-3 fatty acids [39]. Among the microalgae that should
be included as a feed supplement, Nannochloropsis species

